## Never

<!-- This project's rules. They only ever make a release stricter, never looser. -->

- Never treat a release as a deployment. A tag versions the infrastructure code; changing
  real infrastructure is `pulumi preview` then `pulumi up`, per stack, reviewed on its own.
- (more as the team learns them — e.g. "no release while a prod stack has a pending preview")
